alanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Chheda Bhuvan\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Chheda Bhuvan From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 14.6 K/Sq.Ft.","score":0.80405265,"raw_content":null,"id":"0801ba-05"}],"response_time":4.37,"request_id":"da0ce729-7333-4371-8d17-5c4be50f75b0"}